classDiagram
    note for CloudClient "internal/cloud.Client 组合 CatalogSource、四类精确内容端口与 Submission。目录查询只在 Catalog Snapshot 完成；Provider 不暴露旧的分页或逐项发现能力（ADR-021）"

    class CatalogSource {
        <<interface>>
        +CatalogVersion(Context) CatalogVersion
        +DownloadCatalog(Context, destination) error
    }
    class SkillSource {
        <<interface>>
        +DownloadSkill(Context, CatalogEntry, destination) error
    }
    class PluginSource {
        <<interface>>
        +DownloadPlugin(Context, CatalogEntry, destination) error
    }
    class MCPSource {
        <<interface>>
        +GetMCP(Context, CatalogEntry) MCPServer
    }
    class AgentSource {
        <<interface>>
        +DownloadAgent(Context, CatalogEntry, destination) error
    }
    class Submission {
        <<interface>>
        +Submit(Context, SubmissionRequest) SubmissionResult
        +GetSubmission(Context, id) SubmissionDetail
        +ListSubmissions(Context, SubmissionListQuery) SubmissionList
    }
    class CloudClient {
        <<interface: internal/cloud.Client>>
    }

    CloudClient --|> CatalogSource
    CloudClient --|> SkillSource
    CloudClient --|> PluginSource
    CloudClient --|> MCPSource
    CloudClient --|> AgentSource
    CloudClient --|> Submission

    class CatalogVersion {
        +SHA256 string
        +Size int64
    }
    class CatalogEntry {
        +Ref PowerRef
        +Description string
        +Message string
        +ContentType string
        +ContentSize int64
        +ContentMD5 string
        +PublishedAt string
        +Tags []string
    }
    class PowerRef {
        +Type PowerType
        +Name string
        +Version string
    }
    CatalogSource --> CatalogVersion : version response
    CatalogEntry *-- PowerRef
    SkillSource --> CatalogEntry : authoritative metadata
    PluginSource --> CatalogEntry : authoritative metadata
    MCPSource --> CatalogEntry : authoritative metadata
    AgentSource --> CatalogEntry : authoritative metadata

    class ProviderRegistry {
        <<internal/cloud.ProviderRegistry>>
        +Register(ProviderID, Factory) error
        +Open(ProviderID) CloudClient
    }
    class CompositionRoot {
        <<cmd/apm.newCloudClient>>
    }
    class LocalClient {
        <<internal/cloud/local.Client>>
    }
    class RemoteClient {
        <<internal/cloud/remote.Client>>
    }
    CompositionRoot --> ProviderRegistry : register local and remote
    ProviderRegistry --> CloudClient : open selected provider
    LocalClient ..|> CloudClient
    RemoteClient ..|> CloudClient
    note for LocalClient "每次从 canonical fixture 生成确定性四分组 catalog；精确内容从 fresh snapshot 校验 caller CatalogEntry。Submission 保持 unsupported"
    note for RemoteClient "匿名 GET /resources/version 与无 query 的 GET /resources；content URL 只由 entry.Ref 构造，type/size/MD5 只取 caller CatalogEntry。Submission 使用独立 Bearer 请求"

    class CallerCatalogFile {
        <<absent private destination>>
    }
    class CallerPrivateDirectory {
        <<Skill or Plugin destination>>
    }
    class CallerPrivateAgentFile {
        <<agent.yaml destination>>
    }
    CatalogSource --> CallerCatalogFile : writes exact opaque JSON bytes
    SkillSource --> CallerPrivateDirectory : writes verified Skill tree
    PluginSource --> CallerPrivateDirectory : writes canonical Plugin tree
    AgentSource --> CallerPrivateAgentFile : writes original YAML bytes

    class MCPResource {
        +SchemaVersion int
        +Name string
        +Version string
        +Description string
        +Definition MCPServer
    }
    class MCPServer {
        +Transport MCPTransport
        +Command string
        +Args []string
        +URL string
    }
    MCPResource *-- MCPServer
    MCPSource --> MCPResource : strict decode and identity check
    MCPSource --> MCPServer : returns cloned Definition

    class SubmissionRequest {
        +Type PowerType
        +Name string
        +Version string
        +Description string
        +Message string
        +ContentMD5 string
    }
    class SubmissionResult {
        +Outcome SubmissionOutcome
        +SubmissionID string
        +Status SubmissionStatus
        +StatusURL string
    }
    class SubmissionListQuery {
        +Status SubmissionStatus
        +Type PowerType
        +Name string
    }
    class SubmissionDetail {
        +SubmissionID string
        +Description string
        +Message string
        +Timeline []SubmissionEvent
    }
    Submission --> SubmissionRequest
    Submission --> SubmissionResult
    Submission --> SubmissionListQuery
    Submission --> SubmissionDetail
    note for SubmissionListQuery "active-only、最多 20 条；无 cursor、limit 或时间范围。该认证查询不使用 catalog stale fallback"
